OL,3,AAcquitted 'China spy': I was fall guy
OL,4,Afor security services
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British man who was charged with
OL,7,Fspying for China has told the BBC he
OL,8,Fwas a "convenient fall guy" for UK
OL,9,Fpolice and security services who wanted
OL,10,Fto put espionage threats by foreign
OL,11,Fstates "on the map".
OL,13,FChris Cash, a former parliamentary
OL,14,Fresearcher, has shared more than 6,000
OL,15,Fmessages with us revealing how a
OL,16,FChinese official sought information
OL,17,Fabout sensitive political matters in
OL,18,Fthe UK - including the 2022 Tory
OL,19,Fleadership battle to decide the next
OL,20,Fprime minister.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
