OL,3,AAcquitted 'China spy': I was fall guy
OL,4,Afor security services
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe messages show how Cash's friend in
OL,7,FChina, Chris Berry - with whom he had
OL,8,Fbeen sharing information - dramatically
OL,9,Fdescribed a "secret" meeting between
OL,10,FBerry and a high-ranking Chinese
OL,11,Fofficial.
OL,13,FBerry said he had been told that China
OL,14,Fwas concerned about how a British MP it
OL,15,Fhad sanctioned might be promoted to a
OL,16,Fcabinet role.
